WEBVTT

01:54.330 --> 01:55.680
Fits perfectly!

01:55.680 --> 01:57.760
A paper screen on a raft?

02:00.890 --> 02:01.920
There.

02:01.920 --> 02:02.970
Is the roof fine like this?

02:03.370 --> 02:04.470
Yeah.

02:04.470 --> 02:05.430
It looks good.

02:08.350 --> 02:10.850
N-No, that's not a shisa.

02:08.350 --> 02:13.900
Many people in Okinawa put a shisa on their rooftops or gates to protect the family from evil.

02:12.380 --> 02:15.090
Hey, Kaname-chan, does this look cool?

02:16.740 --> 02:18.860
Well, I don't know how to put it...

02:19.230 --> 02:22.220
Now, I just need to finish the interior and get a solar panel...

02:22.220 --> 02:24.280
Well, I'm off to school!

02:24.280 --> 02:24.910
Alright.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.120
Let's go, Kaname-chan.

02:27.420 --> 02:29.820
Oh crap, I forgot my wallet.

02:29.820 --> 02:32.490
Then, I'll head to the bridge first.

02:40.300 --> 02:42.050
Good morning, Ono-chan!

02:42.390 --> 02:44.750
Let's do our best today!

02:45.620 --> 02:46.810
Hey, hey.

02:51.180 --> 02:53.520
Do you go to Umisho?

02:54.600 --> 02:55.480
Yes.

02:55.480 --> 02:59.450
Umisho 2nd Year Class 8, International Studies, Ninagawa Amuro.

03:02.230 --> 03:07.060
Maaya is going to attend school under International Studies as well.

03:07.060 --> 03:09.010
I'll be a 1st year though.

03:09.010 --> 03:10.710
Nice to meet you, Senpai.

03:11.060 --> 03:13.200
Nice to meet you, Kouhai.

03:13.200 --> 03:15.400
Oh yeah, because of Maaya,

03:15.400 --> 03:19.230
there will be people interviewing me, and fans flocking to school, but don't worry about it.

03:20.070 --> 03:21.580
Interview?

03:22.130 --> 03:23.240
Fans?

03:24.880 --> 03:27.100
You found out already!

03:28.310 --> 03:32.400
Yep. Actually, Maaya is...

03:32.400 --> 03:36.570
a fashion magazine model, and the national tournament backstroke champion for two years in a row.

03:36.570 --> 03:38.570
<i>The</i> Nanako Maaya!

03:38.920 --> 03:40.160
Geez.

03:40.160 --> 03:42.570
You can't tell anyone!

03:42.570 --> 03:43.480
Backstroke?

03:43.480 --> 03:44.410
Backstroke, huh?

03:46.020 --> 03:47.940
So you're a swimmer!

03:47.940 --> 03:49.340
That's what I've been saying.

03:49.340 --> 03:50.760
I was the champion two years in a row in middle school.

03:50.760 --> 03:51.620
You're a moron.

03:51.970 --> 03:53.670
I'm a swimmer, too.

03:55.580 --> 03:57.720
A bathing suit under her clothes?

03:57.720 --> 03:59.880
Are... you...

04:01.710 --> 04:03.890
Imitating Maaya!

04:05.640 --> 04:07.410
We're the same!

04:07.410 --> 04:10.390
It's the "Always Keep Swimming on Your Mind" policy, right?

04:10.390 --> 04:12.890
The only one that's allowed to do that is Maaya.

04:13.240 --> 04:16.530
But I see you're a fan,

04:16.530 --> 04:18.220
so I'll forgive you.

04:18.220 --> 04:19.240
What happened?

04:19.240 --> 04:21.340
There's a huge crowd here.

04:21.340 --> 04:22.530
Kaname-chan.

04:22.820 --> 04:25.060
I made a new friend.

04:25.060 --> 04:26.570
Another seal?

04:29.250 --> 04:31.540
Okky!

04:31.940 --> 04:34.670
It's been so long!

04:34.670 --> 04:35.920
Hey, who are you?

04:36.450 --> 04:38.270
It's Maaya.

04:38.270 --> 04:41.330
I used to live next door when we were in elementary school.

04:42.300 --> 04:43.630
You want to go to school now?

04:43.630 --> 04:45.120
Yep, Okky!

04:46.810 --> 04:48.430
Is it good?

04:48.430 --> 04:48.970
Yep.

04:50.220 --> 04:51.010
Could it be?

04:51.010 --> 04:51.850
Maaya?

04:53.860 --> 04:55.650
Okky, let's go take a bath.

04:55.650 --> 04:58.590
No way, you're gonna tear it off.

04:59.220 --> 05:02.560
Are you saying that Maaya's food isn't edible?!

05:03.570 --> 05:08.450
I wanted to live here again, so I asked my dad, and we moved back.

05:08.450 --> 05:09.890
Let's be friends again.

05:10.990 --> 05:12.390
You came back...

05:18.240 --> 05:20.960
So you know Okky.

05:21.270 --> 05:23.210
So what are you? His girlfriend?

05:23.780 --> 05:26.240
Well, is that how it is?

05:26.240 --> 05:28.040
Since we are living together right now.

05:28.040 --> 05:28.910
Together?

05:28.910 --> 05:30.040
Wait!

05:30.040 --> 05:31.640
Aren't you leaving soon?!

05:32.570 --> 05:33.970
Not bad.

05:33.970 --> 05:36.690
W-Well, there is a big explanation for it...

05:37.040 --> 05:42.660
Hey, hey, since we're already wearing our bathing suits, do you want to go swimming in the ocean?

05:42.660 --> 05:43.730
The ocean?

05:45.270 --> 05:47.210
Sorry.

05:47.210 --> 05:49.620
Maaya doesn't like the ocean.

05:49.620 --> 05:52.620
It's sticky, and there are weird creatures,

05:54.580 --> 05:59.410
but I'll take it off for the fans.

06:02.900 --> 06:04.780
That's a cool bathing suit!

06:04.780 --> 06:07.510
Her love for showing off hasn't changed at all.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.060
What do you think?

06:10.060 --> 06:12.640
Maaya's got an adult body, right?

06:12.920 --> 06:14.540
Well...

06:15.110 --> 06:17.640
But taking off your clothes in the middle of the street is...

06:17.990 --> 06:20.020
Now, let's swim!

06:23.530 --> 06:25.030
I'm not gonna swim.

06:25.420 --> 06:27.150
Why?

06:31.920 --> 06:34.290
Okky!

06:34.640 --> 06:40.110
She thinks Maaya has a small chest and is making fun of me in her mind!

06:40.510 --> 06:42.000
I'm not doing that.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.210
Moron.

06:48.300 --> 06:50.470
And we've got another trouble maker.

06:54.580 --> 06:57.770
Do you know about that girl that transferred in yesterday, named Nanako?

06:58.120 --> 06:59.420
Yes, I do.

06:59.420 --> 07:01.500
She's a model for a fashion magazine.

07:01.500 --> 07:02.980
She's cute.

07:03.380 --> 07:07.510
I heard she was ranked number one in the country for the backstroke event.

07:07.510 --> 07:09.030
She has such a beautiful form.

07:10.550 --> 07:11.770
She's fast.

07:11.770 --> 07:13.390
One minute and four seconds.

07:13.390 --> 07:14.730
As expected.

07:14.730 --> 07:16.700
So this is the national level.

07:24.540 --> 07:26.380
Nice meet you boys.

07:28.610 --> 07:31.380
S-She's cute.

07:32.460 --> 07:37.300
I didn't think a girl ranked number one in the country for two years in a row would come to this school.

07:37.300 --> 07:40.600
Who's been to the inter-high tournament here?

07:40.980 --> 07:43.110
I went last year.

07:43.110 --> 07:44.860
Did you win?

07:45.190 --> 07:47.700
No, I lost at the prelims in the 100 meter freestyle event.

07:47.700 --> 07:48.900
Pre?!

07:49.180 --> 07:55.620
Well, I'll have everyone cheering for Umisho after Maaya wins the inter-high tournament.

07:55.620 --> 07:57.960
I'm sorry, Senpai!

07:57.960 --> 08:01.030
She's never had any manners!

08:01.550 --> 08:05.610
Well, I heard that she was rather arrogant.

08:02.420 --> 08:05.610
But, but, I think she has some good points, too!

08:05.610 --> 08:06.240
Probably...

08:06.240 --> 08:08.940
It's true that she has more results.

08:08.940 --> 08:10.050
But...

08:10.290 --> 08:13.240
do you know Nanako-san?

08:14.050 --> 08:15.600
Well, yes.

08:17.720 --> 08:20.350
We're childhood friends, right, Okky?!

08:20.350 --> 08:21.810
H-Hey!

08:23.940 --> 08:25.300
Stop!

08:26.880 --> 08:28.290
Ow.

08:28.290 --> 08:29.690
You're mean.

08:29.690 --> 08:32.390
What if I got injured?

08:32.390 --> 08:34.410
It's because you suddenly jumped on me.

08:34.770 --> 08:36.660
A-Are you all right?

08:39.500 --> 08:40.840
Thanks.

08:41.350 --> 08:43.450
You're very kind.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.920
Maaya might fall in love.

08:51.790 --> 08:52.990
Okiura, you're mean.

08:55.410 --> 08:58.430
I wonder how many men she's made fall in love with her.

08:57.670 --> 08:59.030
Okiura, you're mean.

09:04.300 --> 09:07.230
Hugging a boy in front of so many people,

09:08.180 --> 09:10.940
maybe I should just give it a try.

09:14.890 --> 09:18.080
I would like to touch the chest of a boy.

09:18.080 --> 09:21.630
Thank.. you... very much.

09:23.860 --> 09:31.380
But they might not like it, because I'm not good at demanding attention.

09:31.380 --> 09:32.540
Shizuoka.

09:32.540 --> 09:33.470
What's wrong?

09:33.470 --> 09:34.070
Hey!

09:34.070 --> 09:35.430
Let's compare!

09:35.430 --> 09:36.450
Stop it!

09:36.450 --> 09:38.720
Who's the biggest?!

09:41.900 --> 09:45.450
But you know, Maaya-tan is cute.

09:45.940 --> 09:48.980
Why are you so popular, Okiura-senpai?

09:49.330 --> 09:51.940
No, we're just childhood friends.

09:54.290 --> 09:55.110
Huh?

09:59.050 --> 10:00.360
What are you doing?

10:00.830 --> 10:04.080
I'm waiting for the other girls to finish changing.

10:04.080 --> 10:04.910
Why?

10:07.820 --> 10:12.440
Because they're being mean and not letting me use the room.

10:12.930 --> 10:15.320
I feel bad for Maaya-tan.

10:15.320 --> 10:19.810
And I don't want to change with the big chested girl.

10:19.810 --> 10:21.140
That's what she's actually thinking.

10:21.560 --> 10:24.970
Stop being selfish, geez.

10:24.970 --> 10:25.830
What do you mean?!

10:25.830 --> 10:27.430
Maaya is in trouble!

10:28.190 --> 10:30.970
Captain, where have you been?

10:30.970 --> 10:32.810
Practice is already over.

10:32.810 --> 10:37.200
Well, I was doing some research and development on my new speedo.

10:39.070 --> 10:41.440
You must be the new member.

10:43.350 --> 10:45.560
Captain!

10:45.560 --> 10:46.750
Already?

10:47.100 --> 10:51.310
I can't change because I was chased out by the girls,

10:51.310 --> 10:54.130
so make a changing room for Maaya.

10:55.070 --> 10:58.880
P-l-e-a-s-e.

10:58.880 --> 11:01.420
You idiot!

11:01.420 --> 11:05.610
If there's no changing room, you just take it off right here!

11:09.020 --> 11:09.820
See ya.

11:09.820 --> 11:11.660
W-What is he?

11:11.660 --> 11:14.340
Maaya's upward glance didn't work.

11:14.780 --> 11:16.480
What did he come here for?

11:17.370 --> 11:19.210
Damn, there's no choice.

11:19.210 --> 11:20.660
I guess I'll use them.

11:21.700 --> 11:23.380
Hey, you guys.

11:23.380 --> 11:27.060
Wouldn't it be better if we had a new changing room?

11:27.060 --> 11:29.740
Maaya wants you guys to build it.

11:29.740 --> 11:32.790
We don't have space to build something like that.

11:33.140 --> 11:36.110
You can make it inside the boy's changing room.

11:36.110 --> 11:37.020
Right?

11:37.020 --> 11:39.340
If we do that, we can change together.

11:46.860 --> 11:47.770
Together.

11:48.060 --> 11:51.060
We'll make Maaya-tan's room and change together!

11:51.060 --> 11:52.650
Yeah!

11:53.150 --> 11:54.420
All right.

11:54.420 --> 11:55.670
Thanks.

11:56.080 --> 11:58.230
Not again.

12:17.810 --> 12:19.130
This is not my fault.

12:19.520 --> 12:22.090
We're gonna get in trouble if we leave it out here.

12:22.990 --> 12:26.630
I've gotta do something before Orizuka-senpai shows up.

12:26.630 --> 12:28.060
Do what?

12:30.200 --> 12:31.910
Orizuka-senpai.

12:31.910 --> 12:36.560
Okiura-kun, what is it that you have to do?

12:36.560 --> 12:39.080
Um, you see...

12:39.080 --> 12:40.570
What is it?

12:41.480 --> 12:42.300
What?!

12:42.300 --> 12:43.550
What is this?!

12:43.550 --> 12:46.530
This is the stuff from the storage room!

12:46.920 --> 12:48.370
What's going on here?!

12:48.370 --> 12:49.990
What's going on inside?!

12:50.470 --> 12:51.580
You might not want to look...

12:55.770 --> 12:56.930
What is this?

12:56.930 --> 12:59.460
Well, they're redecorating the room.

12:59.810 --> 13:01.210
Hey, boys!

13:01.210 --> 13:02.720
Clean up what you left outside!

13:03.070 --> 13:05.050
You must not enter our holy land!

13:06.500 --> 13:07.490
What do you mean "holy land"?

13:07.490 --> 13:08.660
Let me in!

13:13.410 --> 13:15.360
Do you think you can get away with this?

13:16.590 --> 13:17.600
What's that sound?

13:17.960 --> 13:20.110
M-Mysterious holes in the wall!

13:24.450 --> 13:25.800
Hey.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.320
C-Captain!

13:28.660 --> 13:30.640
You guys are so unrefined.

13:30.640 --> 13:33.770
You should have told me you guys were gonna remodel the room.

13:34.290 --> 13:37.110
I'm actually pretty good with carpentry.

13:37.110 --> 13:39.430
No, they weren't going that far.

13:39.430 --> 13:42.290
Hey, can you open holes just like that?

13:42.290 --> 13:43.340
What about the strength of the walls?

13:46.560 --> 13:48.020
What is this?!

13:48.020 --> 13:50.660
This is Maaya-tan's very own changing room.

13:50.660 --> 13:51.430
Don't get any closer!

13:52.240 --> 13:53.930
Changing room?

13:53.930 --> 13:56.340
Then let's change!

13:57.240 --> 13:58.310
U-Um.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.870
Yay!

13:59.870 --> 14:01.030
W-Wait!

14:01.490 --> 14:03.270
Is it this one?

14:05.000 --> 14:07.040
What wonderful lighting!

14:07.040 --> 14:09.140
It's Arabian.

14:09.680 --> 14:13.260
Isn't this cloth a little bit see through?

14:14.670 --> 14:16.540
Using it without asking!

14:16.540 --> 14:18.050
Then, let's strip!

14:18.050 --> 14:19.130
Done!

14:19.130 --> 14:20.690
Amuro-senpai, you change fast!

14:20.690 --> 14:22.520
Shizuoka-san, you strip, too.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.300
No!

14:24.220 --> 14:25.380
Um...

14:25.380 --> 14:26.590
It's okay.

14:27.060 --> 14:29.490
I can change by myself.

14:29.490 --> 14:31.810
Strip, strip.

14:31.810 --> 14:33.440
That's an amazing bra!

14:33.440 --> 14:34.850
Strip!

14:36.150 --> 14:37.330
What is this?

14:36.530 --> 14:38.060
It's flat.

14:38.460 --> 14:40.560
There's an air pump right there.

14:40.910 --> 14:42.520
Let's blow it up.

14:45.780 --> 14:47.820
H-Hey, you guys!

14:48.170 --> 14:49.440
Here we go!

14:54.970 --> 14:56.250
No way!

14:56.600 --> 14:57.950
Lets see...

14:57.950 --> 15:00.290
I wonder if the changing room is done.

15:00.690 --> 15:03.800
The boys are useless after the changing room is finished.

15:03.800 --> 15:06.300
I'll kick them out for a random reason.

15:06.650 --> 15:08.800
Hey, is it done?

15:15.560 --> 15:18.390
Hey, look at what I've found.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.060
Here.

15:19.400 --> 15:22.850
This is tasty, but we're not allowed to eat it, right?

15:25.050 --> 15:27.420
S-Shizuoka-san is...

15:29.990 --> 15:31.740
Hey!

15:31.740 --> 15:35.000
Why would a boy have a big chest?!

15:35.570 --> 15:36.490
Don't hit the wall!

15:39.670 --> 15:41.290
There are cracks in the wall.

15:41.610 --> 15:42.750
E-Everyone!

15:43.200 --> 15:45.120
Run for it!

15:55.570 --> 15:57.110
This is the worst.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.950
Where's Orizuka-senpai?

16:13.010 --> 16:14.710
She went to the staff room.

16:14.710 --> 16:16.950
She was called in by a teacher.

16:17.300 --> 16:19.760
I'm not surprised that she was,

16:20.460 --> 16:22.670
since the clubroom ended up looking like that.

16:23.040 --> 16:25.170
They should rebuild it,

16:26.660 --> 16:29.170
and then make a changing room for Maaya.

16:29.480 --> 16:31.680
We don't have that kind of money.

16:32.030 --> 16:37.180
The problem we're facing is that we only have one place to change.

16:37.530 --> 16:40.400
Then the boys should use the girl's room.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.670
Why's that?!

16:41.670 --> 16:44.190
This was the boy's fault to begin with!

16:44.540 --> 16:48.190
It's the girl's fault for leaving out Maaya-tan.

16:48.190 --> 16:49.190
Huh?

16:49.530 --> 16:52.610
Plus, the boys have been treated poorly in the past.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.700
We can't help it.

16:54.700 --> 16:58.490
There aren't as many members, and the girls are better swimmers.

17:00.310 --> 17:01.750
Now you've done it.

17:02.100 --> 17:03.330
W-What is it?

17:03.680 --> 17:06.180
Then have a match with us.

17:06.180 --> 17:07.790
Boys vs. Girls.

17:07.790 --> 17:10.340
The winner gets the room.

17:10.680 --> 17:11.970
Sounds interesting.

17:11.970 --> 17:13.550
We'll take that challenge.

17:13.550 --> 17:16.090
Do you think you can beat the girls?

17:16.090 --> 17:17.350
Yay!

17:17.350 --> 17:18.350
Go!

17:18.750 --> 17:20.850
It's a match!

17:21.220 --> 17:23.420
A match with the boys...

17:23.420 --> 17:26.490
I might have wanted to do this before...

17:26.490 --> 17:28.760
All right, Shizuoka, I'll leave it to you.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.400
You're not going to do it?

17:31.400 --> 17:33.360
M-Me?

17:34.310 --> 17:39.430
Shizuoka had good results at the Kantou tournament.

17:39.430 --> 17:41.180
Do you think you can win?!

17:44.180 --> 17:46.920
W-What should I do?

17:47.270 --> 17:49.630
Takeda-kun, do your best.

17:50.830 --> 17:52.630
I'm gonna do it.

17:52.630 --> 17:57.430
We're gonna get our room, and then change with Maaya-tan!

17:58.010 --> 18:00.010
Victory!

18:01.330 --> 18:03.220
Here we go!

18:03.570 --> 18:04.940
Hold it right there!

18:06.880 --> 18:07.980
Captain!

18:08.460 --> 18:12.480
I'll be participating in this match as well.

18:12.480 --> 18:14.200
Why?!

18:14.200 --> 18:17.160
If Takeda wins, the boys will use the room.

18:17.160 --> 18:19.280
If Shizuoka wins, the girls will.

18:19.280 --> 18:21.450
And if I win,

18:21.620 --> 18:24.170
everyone strips outside the clubroom!

18:25.620 --> 18:27.500
Why is that?!

18:29.530 --> 18:30.500
That was good.

18:32.770 --> 18:36.000
Why do I have to get scolded?

18:40.310 --> 18:42.360
Hey, what are you guys doing?

18:42.360 --> 18:43.920
Orizuka-senpai.

18:43.920 --> 18:46.140
They say that it's a match for the room.

18:46.490 --> 18:47.440
Huh?

18:50.230 --> 18:51.940
Are you ready?!

18:52.470 --> 18:53.480
Ready!

18:57.440 --> 19:00.190
What am I supposed to do?

19:00.740 --> 19:06.700
If the captain wins, I can watch the boys change without hesitation.

19:06.700 --> 19:08.000
But...

19:08.000 --> 19:10.710
I don't want them to see me.

19:10.950 --> 19:11.580
Go!

19:14.750 --> 19:17.100
Go, Shizuoka!

19:17.100 --> 19:18.010
Takeda!

19:21.760 --> 19:23.480
As expected from the captain!

19:23.480 --> 19:25.470
Takeda-san has no chance of winning.

19:28.820 --> 19:32.560
Takeda-kun, do you best for Maaya.

19:33.610 --> 19:34.610
Maaya-tan.

19:40.250 --> 19:43.330
And now Takeda-san is raising his speed!

19:43.610 --> 19:45.830
You guys, do your best!

19:48.000 --> 19:50.500
Now, there's only a little bit of distance left!

19:55.000 --> 19:56.830
Who's the winner?!

19:56.830 --> 19:58.010
Is it Shizuoka?

19:58.360 --> 19:59.220
Is it Takeda?

19:59.530 --> 20:01.470
Or is it Captain Ikamasa?

20:04.990 --> 20:06.560
The winner is...

20:08.630 --> 20:09.880
Ono-chan?!

20:11.100 --> 20:12.900
Or not...

20:12.900 --> 20:16.610
It's Domon-sensei wearing the Ono-chan hat, an Ono Island souvenir.

20:17.990 --> 20:21.110
And why are you at our school?!

20:21.520 --> 20:28.430
N-No, since Umisho doesn't have someone to call coach, I was gonna magnificently teach you guys a lot of things.

20:28.430 --> 20:29.120
A-And...

20:34.410 --> 20:35.630
Wow.

20:37.290 --> 20:39.820
Everyone, playtime is over.

20:39.820 --> 20:41.380
Let's practice seriously.

20:41.730 --> 20:47.160
Nanako-san, you need to follow our rules, now that you have joined the team.

20:48.130 --> 20:51.890
I can't practice properly at a place like this,

20:52.150 --> 20:56.360
because if I stay outdoors too long, my skin will burn.

20:56.360 --> 21:00.730
Maaya models, so I can get in trouble.

21:01.210 --> 21:07.240
The changing room and the pool are bad, so you have to arrange a good facility for me.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.740
That's right, that's right!

21:13.850 --> 21:16.400
I'm sorry, Nanako-san.

21:16.400 --> 21:18.250
Our team doesn't have that kind of money.

21:18.600 --> 21:21.370
If you don't have money, you can just work.

21:21.370 --> 21:22.470
Right, boys?

21:23.490 --> 21:25.640
P-l-e-a-s-e.

21:31.290 --> 21:32.650
I'm going to my part-time job.

21:32.650 --> 21:34.410
I'm going to commit a robbery.

21:35.010 --> 21:36.440
They've been brainwashed!

21:36.950 --> 21:38.670
Stop, you guys!

21:38.670 --> 21:40.780
You all have to calm down!

21:40.780 --> 21:42.940
N-Nanako-san, stop saying such ridiculous things!

21:43.400 --> 21:48.430
But, I can't train at a high-level like this.

21:48.430 --> 21:50.910
There's no point in swimming here.

21:53.610 --> 21:55.460
You!

21:55.870 --> 21:57.500
Ninagawa-san?

21:57.500 --> 21:59.200
Maaya-chan.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.750
W-What is it?

22:01.100 --> 22:03.050
You have a problem?

22:03.050 --> 22:05.300
Did Maaya say something wrong?

22:05.650 --> 22:09.820
Maaya is a already considered to go to inter-highs this year.

22:09.820 --> 22:11.020
I'm on a different level...

22:11.680 --> 22:12.900
No!

22:12.900 --> 22:14.940
There is a point in swimming here.

22:15.490 --> 22:18.440
You can say whatever you like about levels.

22:19.380 --> 22:22.900
Everyone swims here, because it's fun.

22:24.150 --> 22:26.880
She actually said something that made sense.

22:28.360 --> 22:31.680
That's the work of the eldest of six kids.

22:32.660 --> 22:33.380
Right?

22:33.380 --> 22:34.870
So let's swim together.

22:35.230 --> 22:37.920
U-Um...

22:39.360 --> 22:40.790
All right, here we go.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.880
Ready...

22:47.310 --> 22:51.860
I-I'm not going to be tricked by kind words.

22:55.600 --> 22:58.060
She's that kind of person.

24:46.360 --> 24:50.010
Hey, hey, I'm gonna show you a lot of Maaya's charms!

24:50.360 --> 24:54.340
Because I am Nanako Maaya, the middle school backstroke champion for two years in a row.

24:54.340 --> 24:58.440
Well, this swimming team is weird, but I'm gonna be patient because Okky is here.

24:58.440 --> 25:01.120
I'll use my charms to make the boys work...

25:01.980 --> 25:04.870
Hey, why is everyone looking at her?!

25:04.870 --> 25:06.930
It's because you all think I have a small chest!

25:08.380 --> 25:11.410
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho...

25:11.410 --> 25:12.150
"Curse"

25:12.150 --> 25:14.160
You are all morons.
